WEBVTT

01:34.920 --> 01:37.880
ADAPTED FROM DEMON KING
OF JINJIANG LITERATURE CITY

01:37.960 --> 01:40.840
ORIGINAL WORK BY JIULU FEIXIANG

01:50.560 --> 01:51.960
I'll hang those.

01:52.040 --> 01:52.880
All right.

01:52.960 --> 01:54.120
I'll put them here.

01:54.200 --> 01:55.120
This isn't torn.

01:56.840 --> 01:57.760
Okay, chase.

02:02.120 --> 02:03.320
Take it slow.

02:03.400 --> 02:04.520
- This is dirty.
- All right.

02:04.600 --> 02:06.080
- It was cut last time.
- I'll help you.

02:06.160 --> 02:07.160
- Thank you.
- Not bad.

02:07.240 --> 02:08.160
Hand me that one.

02:09.520 --> 02:10.720
Pull it to that side a bit.

02:12.440 --> 02:14.920
- Hang your fishing net too.
- I'm coming.

02:17.240 --> 02:18.240
All right. Go over there.

02:24.440 --> 02:25.560
Take this.

02:27.960 --> 02:28.960
Don't throw this away.

02:29.680 --> 02:30.720
Tighten it up.

02:31.200 --> 02:33.080
Come on. Let me do it for you.

02:33.160 --> 02:34.160
I saw it.

02:35.320 --> 02:36.880
Remember to be careful.

02:39.200 --> 02:41.080
- Be careful with your hand.
- Yes.

02:41.160 --> 02:42.800
- Look at what I got.
- Carry this.

02:43.800 --> 02:44.840
Don't wear it.

02:44.920 --> 02:46.080
You're a young girl.

02:46.160 --> 02:47.520
Not everyone can wear that.

02:48.440 --> 02:49.960
Why not?

02:50.040 --> 02:51.520
Is there something special about this?

02:52.080 --> 02:53.200
That is Frost Salt Flower.

02:53.280 --> 02:54.360
In our tribe,

02:54.440 --> 02:56.520
only widowed women wear it.

02:57.480 --> 03:00.200
So you are all…

03:01.400 --> 03:02.720
All these years,

03:02.800 --> 03:04.640
those kings are always fighting each other

03:04.720 --> 03:06.960
and all the men went to battle.

03:07.040 --> 03:08.480
Every time an obituary comes,

03:08.560 --> 03:10.320
one more woman wears the flower.

03:10.400 --> 03:11.400
Now,

03:11.480 --> 03:13.760
almost every woman in our tribe
is wearing it.

03:15.480 --> 03:16.520
I'm sorry

03:17.000 --> 03:18.800
for bringing up your sad story.

03:18.880 --> 03:19.760
It's fine.

03:20.360 --> 03:21.280
A few years ago,

03:21.360 --> 03:22.560
I cried day and night too.

03:23.520 --> 03:24.720
But what's the use of crying

03:24.800 --> 03:25.880
if you lost your husband?

03:25.960 --> 03:27.080
You still have to live.

03:43.800 --> 03:45.040
This is for you.

04:07.880 --> 04:09.280
Flowers can be revived,

04:09.840 --> 04:11.000
but not people.

04:12.000 --> 04:15.000
I really hope their families
can come back home too.

04:24.440 --> 04:26.280
Stop running or you'll fall again.

04:27.200 --> 04:28.040
Quick.

04:28.800 --> 04:29.640
Where are you going?

04:33.360 --> 04:34.440
My lord.

04:36.280 --> 04:37.120
My lord.

04:37.640 --> 04:38.480
My lord.

04:39.240 --> 04:40.880
- Greetings, my lord.
- Greetings, my lord.

04:42.360 --> 04:44.000
- Greetings, my lord.
- Greetings, my lord.

04:44.720 --> 04:46.480
- Greetings, my lord.
- Greetings, my lord.

04:46.560 --> 04:48.400
- Greetings, my lord.
- Greetings, my lord.

04:51.840 --> 04:53.760
Why aren't you bowing to me?

04:59.640 --> 05:02.400
I have a few questions for you, my lord.

05:02.480 --> 05:05.120
I will bow to you after I get my answers.

05:06.160 --> 05:07.040
Granny Tie.

05:07.600 --> 05:08.720
If you offend the lord,

05:08.800 --> 05:10.560
our whole tribe will die.

05:12.400 --> 05:13.600
Ask away.

05:14.800 --> 05:15.800
My lord.

05:15.880 --> 05:19.200
Where have you been
in the past 30,000 years?

05:20.280 --> 05:22.400
Cangyan Sea has become a wasteland.

05:23.480 --> 05:26.800
Our people have suffered so much.

05:27.560 --> 05:29.960
When everyone was displaced

05:30.040 --> 05:32.560
and had lost their family,

05:32.640 --> 05:33.480
my lord,

05:34.040 --> 05:37.280
where did you go after deserting us?

05:40.840 --> 05:41.720
Spare us, my lord!

05:41.800 --> 05:43.320
My mother-in-law is old and confused.

05:43.400 --> 05:44.400
She's talking nonsense.

05:44.480 --> 05:46.120
We'll take her back now.

05:46.200 --> 05:47.800
- Spare us.
- We'll drag her out now.

05:47.880 --> 05:50.320
- Please have mercy.
- Please spare us.

05:50.400 --> 05:51.440
Have mercy.

05:55.760 --> 05:56.760
Let her continue.

05:57.320 --> 06:00.360
For so many days and nights,

06:01.080 --> 06:02.760
we waited for your return

06:03.360 --> 06:05.320
to save us from this agony.

06:06.160 --> 06:07.680
But you didn't show up.

06:08.400 --> 06:09.280
Now,

06:09.920 --> 06:12.760
my husband and my son

06:12.840 --> 06:15.080
both died on the battlefield.

06:16.600 --> 06:18.680
Yet you returned.

06:28.000 --> 06:29.200
My lord.

06:29.280 --> 06:30.960
I've seen you a long time ago.

06:31.840 --> 06:33.000
When you were little,

06:34.400 --> 06:35.640
about this height,

06:36.600 --> 06:39.280
your father brought you here to hunt.

06:39.360 --> 06:41.320
You also stayed overnight in our tribe.

06:43.000 --> 06:45.520
My grandson is the same age as you.

06:46.280 --> 06:48.160
He hunted rabbits with you.

06:49.600 --> 06:51.560
Then he joined the army,

06:52.240 --> 06:53.880
went to war with you,

06:54.640 --> 06:57.800
and was sealed in the Xuanxu Realm
for 30,000 years.

06:59.960 --> 07:01.600
Now, you're back.

07:03.280 --> 07:04.960
But he's not.

07:14.320 --> 07:15.360
My lord.

07:15.960 --> 07:18.600
Look. She is my daughter-in-law.

07:19.520 --> 07:21.600
My son is gone forever.

07:22.400 --> 07:26.240
But her son can still come back.

07:26.320 --> 07:28.720
I know that offending you

07:28.800 --> 07:30.200
means death.

07:31.440 --> 07:32.600
I'm old.

07:33.360 --> 07:34.560
I've lived long enough.

07:36.520 --> 07:38.680
But even if I die today,

07:39.360 --> 07:41.160
you have to promise me

07:43.520 --> 07:46.320
that you will bring them back

07:48.040 --> 07:51.480
just like the way you took them away.

07:52.760 --> 07:55.000
- Please have mercy, my lord.
- Please have mercy, my lord.

07:55.080 --> 07:57.800
- Please have mercy, my lord.
- Please spare her, my lord.

07:58.560 --> 08:00.880
- Please have mercy, my lord.
- Please spare her, my lord.

08:00.960 --> 08:02.000
Please have mercy, my lord.

08:02.840 --> 08:04.480
- Please have mercy, my lord.
- Please have mercy, my lord.

09:18.120 --> 09:20.880
Why didn't you explain earlier?

09:21.840 --> 09:24.200
You didn't mean to abandon them.

09:24.280 --> 09:28.280
And you're working so hard
for the whole Moon Tribe.

09:28.360 --> 09:29.560
You've never slacked off.

09:30.680 --> 09:31.760
Why?

09:34.840 --> 09:35.880
No reason.

09:41.400 --> 09:42.760
Can't you tell me?

09:48.240 --> 09:49.360
Why should I tell you?

09:50.280 --> 09:51.600
Weren't you the one who said this?

09:51.680 --> 09:52.800
People must have secrets.

09:55.120 --> 09:57.160
But this is different.

10:08.760 --> 10:11.360
Actually, I quite envy you.

10:16.280 --> 10:18.480
The old lady said earlier

10:18.560 --> 10:19.680
that when you were little,

10:20.240 --> 10:22.680
your father would take you hunting
and camping.

10:24.640 --> 10:26.320
I'm just a small plant

10:26.400 --> 10:27.600
with no parents.

10:27.680 --> 10:30.280
I never knew what it's like
to have parents.

10:49.400 --> 10:50.920
The great war is coming.

10:51.600 --> 10:53.680
And there's still no way to counter

10:53.760 --> 10:56.640
the Spirit-Vanishing Arrow Formation
of the Fairy Tribe.

10:57.200 --> 10:58.200
Yes.

10:58.280 --> 11:00.680
We're here today to discuss

11:01.200 --> 11:02.320
how to deal with it.

11:03.360 --> 11:05.040
My lord, I have an idea.

11:15.920 --> 11:18.320
Please forgive me, my lord.

11:18.400 --> 11:20.320
Young lord, why are you so insensible?

11:20.400 --> 11:22.640
If you disturb my lord's military affairs,

11:23.200 --> 11:26.040
you will be branded and lose your tongue.

11:26.120 --> 11:27.080
My lord,

11:27.160 --> 11:29.560
please spare the young lord this time.

11:29.640 --> 11:31.240
THE FORMER MOON SUPREME

11:50.920 --> 11:51.760
Come on.

12:19.920 --> 12:20.960
What are you looking at?

12:21.040 --> 12:22.960
I'm looking at your facial expressions.

12:23.040 --> 12:24.600
This is the first time

12:24.680 --> 12:26.440
I've seen you with that facial expression.

12:26.520 --> 12:27.600
What are you thinking about?

12:29.240 --> 12:30.080
Nothing.

12:30.760 --> 12:32.120
What were you saying just now?

12:33.360 --> 12:34.440
I was saying

12:35.120 --> 12:36.000
I envy you.

12:36.760 --> 12:37.920
What's there to envy?

12:38.840 --> 12:39.760
In my opinion,

12:40.320 --> 12:41.760
it's better to be like you,

12:41.840 --> 12:43.240
nurtured by nature with no attachments.

12:45.600 --> 12:47.840
You don't understand, Big Blockhead.

12:47.920 --> 12:50.560
It's really lonely this way.

12:51.280 --> 12:52.840
It's better to have attachments.

12:53.840 --> 12:55.080
I already told you.

12:55.640 --> 12:57.960
Emotional attachments
will only be a burden.

13:05.400 --> 13:06.800
Why are you smiling?

13:06.880 --> 13:09.040
Because you're saying things
you don't mean.

13:10.000 --> 13:10.880
What do you mean?

13:10.960 --> 13:13.280
When I first arrived at Cangyan Sea,

13:13.360 --> 13:14.920
everyone said

13:15.000 --> 13:17.240
that the Moon Supreme's power
is sovereign.

13:17.320 --> 13:20.760
Anyone who offends you for any reason

13:20.840 --> 13:22.200
will die.

13:22.280 --> 13:23.920
But just now,

13:24.000 --> 13:26.760
that old lady reprimanded you that way.

13:27.320 --> 13:28.640
Yet you didn't punish her.

13:29.480 --> 13:30.720
I think

13:30.800 --> 13:35.280
her love and attachment
to her family moved you.

13:35.360 --> 13:36.200
Right?

13:36.280 --> 13:37.480
Nonsense.

13:38.520 --> 13:40.640
Since she's old and dying,

13:41.320 --> 13:42.560
I couldn't bear to punish her.

13:43.400 --> 13:44.240
You couldn't bear it?

13:45.000 --> 13:49.440
That's sympathy and pity
in the seven emotions.

13:50.760 --> 13:52.840
But you've removed all seven emotions.

13:53.680 --> 13:54.800
How can you…

13:58.960 --> 13:59.840
Could it be…

14:09.360 --> 14:16.360
DONGFANG QINGCANG'S SEA OF EMOTIONS

14:19.840 --> 14:21.000
It's really sprouting.

14:22.320 --> 14:23.400
The last time I was here,

14:23.480 --> 14:24.680
it was still a withered tree.

14:24.760 --> 14:26.200
I can't believe it really sprouted.

14:26.280 --> 14:27.560
Look. I told you.

14:27.640 --> 14:29.520
I can cure your Seven Emotions Tree.

14:54.080 --> 14:54.920
Father.

14:56.080 --> 14:56.920
Father!

14:58.440 --> 14:59.280
Father.

15:00.160 --> 15:02.320
You promised to play cuju with me today.

15:17.480 --> 15:18.800
From now on,

15:18.880 --> 15:20.120
you can never touch it again!

15:36.440 --> 15:37.600
Throw away the wooden sword.

15:37.680 --> 15:39.840
Use this to practice
in the training grounds from now on.

15:40.680 --> 15:41.680
Go now!

15:51.040 --> 15:52.800
After returning from Oblivion River,

15:53.640 --> 15:55.280
I have this nightmare every night.

15:56.960 --> 15:58.120
Is the recovery of my seven emotions

15:59.440 --> 16:00.920
really speeding up?

16:11.800 --> 16:12.920
Big Blockhead.

16:13.600 --> 16:15.360
I heard that you didn't sleep well
these days,

16:15.440 --> 16:17.520
so I prepared this just for you.

16:17.600 --> 16:19.120
Smell it. Does it smell good?

16:19.200 --> 16:20.400
This is an orchid.

16:20.480 --> 16:23.160
But this is not any ordinary orchid.

16:23.240 --> 16:25.160
I made it with my primordial spirit.

16:25.240 --> 16:28.240
- I guarantee you'll sleep until dawn.
- Take it away.

16:32.440 --> 16:35.480
But your Seven Emotions Tree
has just recovered.

16:35.560 --> 16:37.280
How dare you mention that to me?

16:45.120 --> 16:46.720
I endured suffering in hell

16:46.800 --> 16:48.160
in order to remove my emotions.

16:48.840 --> 16:51.240
Because of you, my emotions returned.

16:51.320 --> 16:53.600
Isn't my suffering all in vain?

16:53.680 --> 16:54.960
I have to be ruthless

16:55.040 --> 16:56.960
to kill people everywhere
and lead the Moon Tribe.

16:57.600 --> 16:59.960
What do you want me to do
with my responsibilities?

17:01.280 --> 17:02.280
I just

17:02.840 --> 17:04.280
don't want to see you suffer.

17:04.359 --> 17:05.880
I never suffered.

17:07.000 --> 17:08.680
This is all because of you.

17:08.760 --> 17:09.960
My suffering only began

17:10.040 --> 17:11.520
when you showed up.

17:12.480 --> 17:14.599
Why did you act on your own and interfere?

17:18.640 --> 17:19.960
Don't let me see your face again.

17:40.080 --> 17:43.040
So this is the legendary
Spiritual Treasures Pavilion.

17:43.120 --> 17:45.200
I got in here so easily.

17:47.800 --> 17:50.520
This is indeed Moon Supreme's
treasure room.

17:51.400 --> 17:53.040
Silk from Yunmeng Lake.

17:53.640 --> 17:55.040
Dragon Pearl from Oblivion River.

17:55.680 --> 17:58.120
Fairy Jade from Shuiyuntian.

17:59.200 --> 18:00.960
I'm rich.

18:06.160 --> 18:07.960
I can't believe
I could live to see this day.

18:25.560 --> 18:26.680
Who's there? Halt!

18:37.400 --> 18:38.360
Don't you know me?

18:42.240 --> 18:43.400
If you don't even know me,

18:43.480 --> 18:44.760
how can you work in the palace?

18:47.400 --> 18:50.160
Do you at least know Fairy Orchid?

18:50.240 --> 18:51.160
Of course.

18:51.240 --> 18:53.560
She's a distinguished guest
in Silent Moon Palace.

18:53.640 --> 18:54.880
She's our lord's favorite.

18:56.280 --> 18:58.800
I'm Fairy Orchid's sworn sister.

18:59.920 --> 19:01.080
- Step aside.
- Cut the crap.

19:01.560 --> 19:03.320
Didn't I already tell you?

19:03.400 --> 19:04.720
I'm tired of these dishes.

19:04.800 --> 19:05.800
Don't serve these again.

19:09.640 --> 19:10.920
My lord, please don't be angry.

19:11.000 --> 19:12.360
The old chef must have forgotten

19:12.440 --> 19:13.880
to tell that to the new chef,

19:13.960 --> 19:15.720
so they accidentally served them.

19:15.800 --> 19:17.040
The chef has changed?

19:17.600 --> 19:18.480
Have you forgotten?

19:18.560 --> 19:19.720
A few days ago,
you ordered to let some people

19:19.800 --> 19:21.520
leave the palace
to reunite with their families.

19:22.360 --> 19:23.680
The old chef was also among them.

19:31.880 --> 19:32.720
You may leave first.

19:33.280 --> 19:34.240
- Yes.
- Yes.

19:46.440 --> 19:49.080
My lord, what worries you lately?

19:52.040 --> 19:54.200
My seven emotions are starting
to come back.

19:55.760 --> 19:56.600
Well…

20:12.600 --> 20:13.560
Kneel.

20:15.920 --> 20:16.840
My lord,

20:16.920 --> 20:18.920
while checking
the Spiritual Treasures Pavilion,

20:19.000 --> 20:20.320
we found a thief.

20:20.400 --> 20:22.000
These are the treasures she stole.

20:22.960 --> 20:25.200
She claims that she is the sworn sister
of Fairy Orchid.

20:25.280 --> 20:26.240
I dare not act rashly,

20:26.320 --> 20:27.920
so I'm reporting it to you, my lord.

20:32.440 --> 20:33.440
It's you again.

20:35.280 --> 20:38.800
I haven't settled the score with you yet
for coaxing Orchid into running away.

20:38.880 --> 20:41.560
Now, you're targeting
the Spiritual Treasures Pavilion.

20:45.160 --> 20:46.440
I'm innocent, my lord.

20:46.520 --> 20:48.680
Fairy Orchid was the one
who lent me the Bone Orchid.

20:48.760 --> 20:50.000
I gave it back to her ages ago.

20:50.680 --> 20:53.000
I just arrived today
and didn't know my way around.

20:53.080 --> 20:54.800
I entered the pavilion by accident

20:54.880 --> 20:56.800
and saw some rare things,

20:57.400 --> 20:59.880
so I thought I'd take some
to amuse Fairy Orchid.

21:24.280 --> 21:25.200
My lord.

21:30.320 --> 21:31.920
Are you sure she likes these?

21:34.200 --> 21:35.360
Of course.

21:35.440 --> 21:36.960
Silk and jade and such

21:37.040 --> 21:38.600
can best make a girl happy.

21:39.160 --> 21:40.480
Since she likes them,

21:40.560 --> 21:41.600
give them to her.

21:43.040 --> 21:44.040
Thank you, my lord.

21:45.680 --> 21:46.760
Also,

21:48.280 --> 21:50.200
if she wants anything else from now on,

21:50.280 --> 21:51.320
tell her to just get it.

21:52.280 --> 21:53.200
Yes.

21:58.160 --> 21:59.000
Wait.

23:26.240 --> 23:27.200
Are you crying?

23:29.360 --> 23:30.880
Father asked me to use the iron sword.

23:32.680 --> 23:33.680
It's too heavy to carry.

23:34.400 --> 23:35.480
My hands are wounded.

23:36.760 --> 23:38.000
Carrying an iron sword

23:38.080 --> 23:39.360
means you're all grown up

23:39.840 --> 23:42.560
and you've become
an Iron Blood Warrior of the Moon Tribe.

23:42.640 --> 23:44.800
That's a good thing. Don't cry.

23:51.840 --> 23:52.680
Young lord.

23:53.280 --> 23:54.680
Look at this.

24:01.560 --> 24:03.000
You're a fast learner.

24:04.280 --> 24:06.120
If you won't be the future Moon Supreme,

24:06.200 --> 24:08.480
you'll be a top carpenter in the future.

24:09.680 --> 24:10.520
Really?

24:13.040 --> 24:14.280
But Father said

24:14.840 --> 24:16.560
I can only be
the Moon Supreme in the future.

24:17.240 --> 24:18.600
I have to attack Shuiyuntian

24:19.120 --> 24:20.680
and kill many, many people.

24:22.120 --> 24:23.640
Don't you want to be the Moon Supreme?

24:23.720 --> 24:24.920
I do.

24:25.000 --> 24:26.560
I want to revive Cangyan Sea

24:26.640 --> 24:28.600
and lead the Moon Tribe to a good life.

24:29.360 --> 24:31.200
I want to fulfill Father's expectations

24:31.280 --> 24:32.720
and make him proud of me.

24:32.800 --> 24:33.840
That's it.

24:34.520 --> 24:35.960
Whether you're the Moon Supreme

24:36.040 --> 24:37.120
or a carpenter,

24:37.680 --> 24:39.480
you have to be strong.

24:43.080 --> 24:45.760
Do you know who this statue is?

24:47.280 --> 24:49.240
This is the founder of our Moon Tribe,

24:49.320 --> 24:50.680
the first Moon Supreme,

24:50.760 --> 24:51.600
Lady Yan.

24:52.360 --> 24:54.080
She led our ancestors

24:54.160 --> 24:55.320
in crossing Oblivion River

24:55.400 --> 24:56.960
and establishing roots in Cangyan Sea.

24:57.040 --> 24:58.760
And we thrived since then.

24:58.840 --> 25:01.720
Look. She has many scars.

25:01.800 --> 25:04.160
Every one of them is a testimony of glory.

25:05.240 --> 25:08.040
You must be a Moon Supreme like her
in the future

25:08.120 --> 25:10.440
and lead our tribe back to glory.

25:13.800 --> 25:16.360
And this is your first scar.

25:27.320 --> 25:28.280
My lord, please don't be angry.

25:29.200 --> 25:31.440
I will take this thief right away
and interrogate her.

25:35.480 --> 25:37.360
- Let's go.
- There's no need.

25:40.000 --> 25:41.560
Kill her on the spot.

25:42.600 --> 25:43.800
Please spare me, my lord!

25:45.480 --> 25:46.440
I was negligent.

25:46.520 --> 25:47.880
Punish me if you want.

25:50.520 --> 25:51.720
Are you disobeying my order?

25:55.160 --> 25:56.000
My lord.

26:26.400 --> 26:27.760
Please, Moon Supreme Lord.

26:27.840 --> 26:28.960
Don't kill Jieli.

26:51.440 --> 26:52.360
Step aside.

26:53.600 --> 26:54.920
Moon Supreme Lord,

26:55.000 --> 26:56.200
listen to me.

26:56.280 --> 26:58.200
It was my idea to escape last time.

26:58.280 --> 26:59.680
I also asked her to steal

26:59.760 --> 27:01.360
from Spiritual Treasures Pavilion.

27:01.440 --> 27:02.640
It's all my fault.

27:02.720 --> 27:04.040
Don't blame her.

27:05.120 --> 27:06.320
Step aside.

27:07.920 --> 27:09.520
She's my only good friend.

27:09.600 --> 27:11.880
I can't watch her die.

27:11.960 --> 27:12.800
Anyway…

27:12.880 --> 27:14.920
I've already made you unhappy anyway.

27:15.000 --> 27:16.680
You also don't want to see me anymore.

27:16.760 --> 27:18.560
If you want to kill someone, then kill me!

27:24.920 --> 27:25.760
My lord.

27:27.600 --> 27:28.520
My lord.

27:30.440 --> 27:31.400
My lord.

27:33.280 --> 27:35.480
Lord Xunfeng is shouting in prison.

27:35.560 --> 27:37.960
He said he wants to pay respects
to the former Moon Supreme.

27:38.560 --> 27:40.640
I came to ask you what to do.

27:54.280 --> 27:55.440
Burn the wood sculpture!

27:55.520 --> 27:56.360
- Yes.
- Yes.

28:01.600 --> 28:03.160
Jieli.

28:03.240 --> 28:04.480
Are you all right?

28:14.160 --> 28:15.000
Why…

28:15.840 --> 28:17.680
Why are you looking at me like that?

28:21.080 --> 28:24.520
It was your idea to steal this time.

28:24.600 --> 28:26.600
Don't blame me for getting you in trouble.

28:26.680 --> 28:27.920
I won't admit it.

28:30.080 --> 28:31.120
Orchid.

28:32.680 --> 28:35.000
Although I've lived for thousands of years

28:35.760 --> 28:37.480
and met many people,

28:38.520 --> 28:40.440
you are the number one fool I know

28:42.640 --> 28:44.280
in the three realms.

29:00.240 --> 29:02.240
How dare you pay respects to Father

29:02.320 --> 29:04.560
after doing something so stupid?

29:06.040 --> 29:08.680
I wanted to kill you to avenge Father.

29:10.680 --> 29:12.160
I have nothing to be ashamed of.

29:12.800 --> 29:14.280
You want to kill me?

29:14.920 --> 29:16.200
It's not a big deal.

29:16.680 --> 29:18.200
I can forgive you.

29:19.480 --> 29:21.080
But you colluded with the Lord of Haishi

29:22.040 --> 29:23.240
and betrayed your people.

29:24.040 --> 29:27.520
You refined evil qi
with their pain and hatred,

29:28.000 --> 29:30.080
making the primordial spirits

29:30.160 --> 29:31.440
of countless tribesmen shatter

29:31.520 --> 29:32.760
and leaving them without peace.

29:33.320 --> 29:35.320
This is unforgivable.

29:36.480 --> 29:37.680
Nonsense.

29:39.280 --> 29:40.680
Legitimacy belongs to the victor.

29:41.840 --> 29:44.400
Just kill me since I lost.

29:46.440 --> 29:48.560
Why bother making up all the charges?

29:50.760 --> 29:51.960
You're my brother.

29:53.160 --> 29:55.600
You should know better than anyone

29:55.680 --> 29:57.120
whether I need to make up charges

29:58.000 --> 30:00.320
to kill someone.

30:11.560 --> 30:12.920
He never told me

30:13.840 --> 30:15.320
where the evil qi came from.

30:17.960 --> 30:20.160
So you're not the mastermind
behind all this?

30:22.600 --> 30:23.880
Although I hate you a lot,

30:25.280 --> 30:27.040
I am also Father's son.

30:27.600 --> 30:28.880
They are my people too.

30:30.760 --> 30:33.840
Why would I do something
that will hurt my people?

30:38.320 --> 30:41.760
You brought ruin to yourself
and let others manipulate you.

30:42.280 --> 30:43.680
How utterly foolish.

30:45.040 --> 30:45.960
Dongfang Qingcang.

30:47.160 --> 30:49.080
You are one to talk.

30:49.760 --> 30:51.680
Everything started because of you!

30:53.040 --> 30:54.720
If it weren't for revenge,

30:54.800 --> 30:57.080
I wouldn't have been blinded
by that vile man.

31:01.160 --> 31:02.280
Dongfang Qingcang.

31:04.680 --> 31:07.080
Father valued you so much.

31:07.800 --> 31:10.160
He devoted all his life to you.

31:11.360 --> 31:13.200
But you killed Father

31:14.680 --> 31:16.280
just to become the Moon Supreme.

31:19.960 --> 31:21.000
Dongfang Qingcang.

31:22.800 --> 31:25.080
Why on earth did you kill Father?

31:27.600 --> 31:29.280
He is your father,

31:30.120 --> 31:31.600
not mine.

31:44.400 --> 31:46.200
Relay my order.

31:46.760 --> 31:48.000
After three days,

31:48.640 --> 31:50.400
the traitor Xunfeng

31:51.680 --> 31:53.400
will be executed by lightning.

31:56.400 --> 31:57.680
This is just what I want.

31:59.760 --> 32:00.880
It's just what I want.

32:00.960 --> 32:02.440
It's exactly what I want!

32:08.240 --> 32:10.440
My lord, should we postpone the execution?

32:12.440 --> 32:13.280
Why?

32:13.360 --> 32:14.560
Because three days later

32:15.560 --> 32:17.520
is the former Moon Supreme's
death anniversary.

32:28.360 --> 32:29.520
There's no need to delay.

32:30.600 --> 32:31.960
Isn't executing him

32:32.040 --> 32:34.760
on his death anniversary a good way
to show their love for each other?

32:36.520 --> 32:37.400
Yes.

32:44.800 --> 32:46.720
Don't you know healing magic?

32:46.800 --> 32:48.200
Why don't you heal yourself?

32:50.920 --> 32:52.360
With my weak power,

32:52.440 --> 32:54.080
it's fine to keep flowers and plants.

32:54.160 --> 32:56.480
But I'm still far from healing people.

32:59.440 --> 33:00.520
This is wound medicine.

33:00.600 --> 33:01.800
It heals wounds quickly once applied.

33:01.880 --> 33:04.080
No. I don't have any money.

33:04.160 --> 33:06.000
I already owe you a lot.

33:06.080 --> 33:08.120
If I get this on credit again,
I really won't be able to pay you back.

33:08.920 --> 33:09.840
It's free.

33:09.920 --> 33:10.840
It's a gift for you.

33:13.680 --> 33:14.640
It's free?

33:16.120 --> 33:18.280
Did the sun rise from the west today?

33:18.360 --> 33:19.920
Jieli, are you all right?

33:20.920 --> 33:22.680
If you won't take it, I'll take it back.

33:22.760 --> 33:24.440
I'll take it.

33:24.520 --> 33:25.360
Thank you.

33:31.440 --> 33:32.280
Let me do it.

33:32.760 --> 33:33.920
My goodness.

33:42.680 --> 33:43.800
Listen.

33:43.880 --> 33:46.640
Don't think that I'll humble myself to you
just because you saved me.

33:47.280 --> 33:48.600
You made me suffer so much before.

33:48.680 --> 33:50.280
We're even at most.

33:56.680 --> 33:58.600
It's done. Be careful.

33:59.560 --> 34:01.360
Thank you, Jieli.

34:03.440 --> 34:05.480
Moon Supreme Lord is so strange.

34:05.560 --> 34:07.400
You stole so many treasures
from him before

34:07.480 --> 34:08.800
and he didn't even blink.

34:08.880 --> 34:10.440
This time, he suddenly got so angry

34:10.520 --> 34:12.400
just because of a tiny wooden sculpture.

34:14.080 --> 34:16.000
I've asked Shangque.

34:16.760 --> 34:18.440
I was unlucky this time

34:18.520 --> 34:19.679
and offended the lord.

34:19.760 --> 34:20.880
Do you know?

34:20.960 --> 34:22.679
That wooden sculpture
was carved by the lord

34:22.760 --> 34:24.840
and the maid who took care of him
when he was little.

34:25.639 --> 34:26.719
But unexpectedly,

34:26.800 --> 34:29.520
the former Moon Supreme
killed the maid later.

34:30.560 --> 34:31.440
He killed her?

34:31.520 --> 34:32.400
Why?

34:33.800 --> 34:35.159
Who knows?

34:35.239 --> 34:37.199
Then the wooden sculpture went missing.

34:37.280 --> 34:38.159
Who would have known

34:38.239 --> 34:40.120
that someone unawarely stored it
in the Spiritual Treasures Pavilion?

34:41.199 --> 34:43.360
And with some dumb luck, I brought it out.

34:50.679 --> 34:52.679
What are you thinking about now?

34:56.199 --> 34:57.320
By the way,

34:57.400 --> 35:00.000
Shangque said that the lord has been
bad-tempered since he returned

35:00.080 --> 35:01.640
from Oblivion River a few days ago.

35:01.720 --> 35:03.160
You'd better avoid him these days.

35:03.760 --> 35:05.000
Shangque said

35:05.080 --> 35:07.400
that the lord has been bad-tempered
since he came back

35:07.480 --> 35:08.760
from Oblivion River?

35:09.640 --> 35:10.480
Yes.

35:12.000 --> 35:14.840
He said that he would forgive
Lord Xunfeng before.

35:14.920 --> 35:16.440
But just now, he gave orders

35:16.520 --> 35:19.040
to execute Lord Xunfeng by lightning
on the death anniversary

35:19.120 --> 35:20.960
of the former Moon Supreme
three days later.

35:35.200 --> 35:37.640
Have you arranged the public execution

35:38.200 --> 35:39.120
of Xunfeng?

35:40.120 --> 35:41.320
Yes.

35:46.040 --> 35:47.280
Moon Supreme Lord.

35:47.360 --> 35:49.120
I know you don't want to see me now,

35:49.200 --> 35:50.880
but I have a question for you.

35:50.960 --> 35:51.920
I'll leave after that.

35:52.000 --> 35:53.360
I promise I won't bother you.

35:59.440 --> 36:00.360
Let Fairy Orchid in.

36:00.440 --> 36:01.320
- Yes.
- Yes.

36:12.920 --> 36:14.120
Moon Supreme Lord.

36:14.840 --> 36:15.840
Don't be angry

36:16.360 --> 36:17.960
after I ask you.

36:18.840 --> 36:20.000
Ask away.

36:22.800 --> 36:26.000
Did Xunfeng collude
with the Lord of Haishi on purpose?

36:28.480 --> 36:30.320
He was tricked by the Lord of Haishi.

36:31.920 --> 36:33.520
In that case,

36:33.600 --> 36:34.520
Moon Supreme Lord,

36:34.600 --> 36:37.200
can you show mercy and spare his life?

36:37.280 --> 36:39.600
After all, you are family.

36:40.680 --> 36:42.280
His dead father

36:42.800 --> 36:44.480
is his family.

36:45.760 --> 36:47.360
Didn't your father

36:48.240 --> 36:51.160
ever love you?

36:51.240 --> 36:52.280
Never.

36:55.640 --> 36:57.040
How is that possible?

36:57.680 --> 37:01.560
The former Moon Supreme
loved Lord Xunfeng so much.

37:01.640 --> 37:02.720
But why did…

37:07.200 --> 37:08.800
Could there be some misunderstanding?

37:11.560 --> 37:13.960
He indulged and doted on Xunfeng.

37:14.560 --> 37:15.680
But what about me?

37:15.760 --> 37:16.760
No matter what I did,

37:16.840 --> 37:18.480
I couldn't make him smile.

37:18.560 --> 37:20.880
Even when he found out
that I am the gifted talent

37:20.960 --> 37:23.000
who's the only one
that can master Hellfire,

37:23.080 --> 37:24.680
he never smiled at me once.

37:25.240 --> 37:27.640
He even looked at me and said,

37:28.920 --> 37:30.480
"Why you?"

37:38.320 --> 37:41.720
Why did he say that?

37:52.080 --> 37:53.960
Because sooner or later,

37:54.680 --> 37:56.800
the son he hated would replace him.

38:01.600 --> 38:02.440
No.

38:03.280 --> 38:05.240
I don't think that was it.

38:05.320 --> 38:07.800
Do you know
why he removed my seven emotions?

38:11.680 --> 38:14.760
Because tools only need to be sharp

38:14.840 --> 38:17.360
and emotions can only be a burden.

38:20.480 --> 38:21.920
In order to remove all my emotions,

38:22.840 --> 38:24.520
he tortured me again and again.

38:25.960 --> 38:28.280
He even died to achieve his goal.

38:29.880 --> 38:31.440
He told me to kill him

38:32.160 --> 38:33.880
in order to destroy
the Seven Emotions Tree.

38:34.440 --> 38:36.880
But he never expected it

38:37.840 --> 38:39.640
to be resurrected now.

38:45.160 --> 38:46.200
Don't you think

38:47.400 --> 38:48.840
that's ridiculous?

38:55.600 --> 38:56.440
Wait.

39:16.600 --> 39:18.120
Why did the former Moon Supreme

39:20.000 --> 39:21.720
say that?

39:29.680 --> 39:30.760
I already told you.

39:30.840 --> 39:32.800
My lord has been very ill-tempered lately.

39:33.440 --> 39:35.040
Why did you still come to him?

39:35.520 --> 39:36.520
Exactly.

39:37.080 --> 39:40.080
Orchid, you've got some nerve.

39:40.720 --> 39:43.400
Do you know that if a child
won't stop crying in Cangyan Sea at night,

39:43.480 --> 39:45.960
just the mention of the lord's name
would make him stop immediately?

39:46.040 --> 39:48.440
He even killed his own father.

39:49.240 --> 39:50.520
Don't you want to live anymore?

39:51.680 --> 39:52.920
So…

39:53.680 --> 39:55.840
that's what everyone thinks of him.

39:56.560 --> 39:57.480
Of course not.

39:57.560 --> 39:59.280
During Xunfeng's reign as Moon Supreme,

39:59.360 --> 40:01.040
there was continuous civil unrest
in Cangyan Sea.

40:01.120 --> 40:02.240
But once my lord came back,

40:02.800 --> 40:04.400
he ended the war and dispute immediately.

40:04.880 --> 40:06.240
My lord's power and majesty

40:06.320 --> 40:07.800
make him a strong rival

40:07.880 --> 40:08.840
for Shuiyuntian.

40:09.680 --> 40:11.200
But for the Moon Tribe,

40:11.960 --> 40:14.080
it is our hope to protect our peace.

40:17.080 --> 40:18.920
Why did you ask that?

40:20.520 --> 40:22.080
I just think

40:22.160 --> 40:24.840
that Cangyan Sea and Dongfang Qingcang

40:24.920 --> 40:26.640
are different from what the rumors say.

40:27.240 --> 40:29.520
There might be something hidden

40:29.600 --> 40:31.440
behind all those horrible stories
in the past.

40:32.240 --> 40:33.200
However,

40:34.240 --> 40:36.840
the lord killed his father in public.

40:39.200 --> 40:40.720
What hidden story can there be?

40:41.680 --> 40:43.120
He told me to kill him

40:43.760 --> 40:46.360
in order to destroy
the Seven Emotions Tree.

40:47.280 --> 40:49.200
But it's resurrected now.

40:49.760 --> 40:52.480
He and his father…

40:56.560 --> 40:57.520
No.

41:00.440 --> 41:01.760
There must be a hidden story.

41:02.400 --> 41:03.280
Shangque.

41:04.000 --> 41:05.600
Tell me exactly what happened

41:05.680 --> 41:07.280
when the Moon Supreme killed his father.

41:07.360 --> 41:08.480
Don't miss a single detail.
